B.YK=new A.ag("1. Purpose and Acceptance","Cabadbaran CitizenSense is the official citizen-engagement and grievance-handling platform of the City Government of Cabadbaran, Province of Agusan del Norte. It is designed to empower residents to submit civic concerns, report public infrastructure and sanitation issues, and track their resolution transparently. By creating an account, accessing, or submitting complaints through CitizenSense, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms of Use and the Data Privacy Notice. If you do not agree, please refrain from using the platform.")
B.Za=new A.ag("2. Least Privilege Role Architecture","CitizenSense enforces strict Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) following the principle of least privilege:\n\u2022 Citizen: Self-registered residents who may submit complaints, upload supporting evidence, track the progress of their own filed concerns, and manage their profile.\n\u2022 Office Staff: Designated personnel assigned strictly to specific city departments (e.g., City Engineering Office, City Health Office, CENRO, CSWDO, CDRRMO, Public Safety, Mayor's Office). Staff can only view, review, and resolve complaints routed to their designated office.\n\u2022 Administrator: Authorized city administrative officers who manage user statuses, oversee city-wide analytics, and audit cross-departmental compliance.\nPublic self-registration is strictly restricted to the Citizen role. Staff and Administrator accounts are provisioned and vetted exclusively by the City Government and cannot be self-created.")
B.Zb=new A.ag("3. Legitimate Email & Security Verification","To preserve the integrity of municipal records, eliminate fraudulent or automated prank entries, and maintain reliable communication, every registering citizen must provide a legitimate, active email address. The system requires confirmation via a single-use 6-digit email verification code (OTP). Accounts remain inactive and cannot file complaints until verified. Account recovery and password resets likewise require verification codes delivered to the registered email.")
B.YO=new A.ag("4. Standards for Filing Complaints","When submitting concerns, citizens agree to provide truthful, accurate, and constructive information:\n\u2022 Scope: Complaints must relate to public matters and city services within Cabadbaran City and its barangays.\n\u2022 Evidence: Attachments (photos/documents) must be genuine and relevant (JPG, PNG, or PDF format, up to 5MB).\n\u2022 Conduct: Vulgar, defamatory, abusive, or malicious submissions are strictly prohibited and will result in account suspension and potential legal liability.\n\u2022 Non-Emergency Notice: CitizenSense is an administrative grievance and service-request mechanism. It is NOT an emergency dispatch system. In urgent, life-threatening events (active fires, crimes in progress, or immediate medical emergencies), citizens must contact 911 or local emergency hotlines immediately.")
B.Z_=new A.ag("5. Machine Learning & Automated Triage","CitizenSense integrates Machine Learning (ML) and Natural Language Processing (NLP) models to assist city personnel by automatically assessing submitted complaints to suggest office categories, detect sentiment, and recommend priority ratings (Low, Medium, High, or Critical). These automated outputs serve as preliminary recommendations to expedite response times; all final assessments, actions, and official responses are validated and determined by authorized human city personnel.")
B.YV=new A.ag("6. Data Privacy Notice (R.A. 10173 Compliance)","In accordance with Republic Act No. 10173 (Data Privacy Act of 2012), the City Government of Cabadbaran is committed to safeguarding your personal data:\n\u2022 Information Collected: Full name, verified email, barangay location, complaint narrative, attached media, status update logs, and authentication timestamps.\n\u2022 Purpose of Processing: To verify complainant identity, route complaints to appropriate city departments, coordinate field investigations, communicate status updates, and generate anonymized city analytics.\n\u2022 Confidentiality: Your personal information is accessible only to you, the assigned department personnel, and authorized system administrators. We do not sell, rent, or commercialize your personal data.")
B.YN=new A.ag("7. Security Measures & Data Retention","Your data is protected using industry-standard technical and organizational safeguards:\n\u2022 All transmissions are secured through end-to-end HTTPS encryption.\n\u2022 Passwords are cryptographically salted and hashed using PBKDF2 with SHA-256.\n\u2022 Verification codes (OTP) are hashed and automatically expire within 10 minutes.\n\u2022 Complaint records are retained for historical audit trails, resolution tracking, and statutory reporting requirements in accordance with municipal retention policies.")
B.Z1=new A.ag("8. Complainant Rights & Contact Information","Under R.A. 10173, you have the right to be informed, access your personal information, request reasonable corrections to inaccurate data, and object to processing where permitted by law. For inquiries regarding data privacy or platform use, you may reach the City Government of Cabadbaran Data Protection Officer at City Hall, Cabadbaran City, Agusan del Norte.")
B.Tg=s([B.YK,B.Za,B.Zb,B.YO,B.Z_,B.YV,B.YN,B.Z1],A.ax("E<+(k,k)>"))
